## Story Validation Origin Check

When a story is created to address a specific CLAUDE.md requirement,
user feedback, or carry-over item, the story validation gate MUST
verify that the original requirement is satisfied -- not just the
story's own acceptance criteria. If the story ACs do not fully
satisfy the original requirement, the story fails validation
regardless of whether its own ACs pass.

