## Pre-Deploy Schema/API Field Check

<!-- Customize this for your project's API layer:
     - GraphQL: introspection query against live schema
     - REST: verify OpenAPI spec matches live endpoint
     - gRPC: verify proto definitions match deployed service -->

Before adding any new field to an API query, dev teammates MUST
verify the field exists in the live schema/API via verification
against the deployed service. If the field does not exist in the
currently deployed service, the query change MUST be gated behind
the service deployment (deploy the schema change first, verify the
field exists, then update queries). Unknown fields cause hard
errors.

